# Cloudflare Pages SPA rewrite.
# The app is URL-driven (/, /map, /trucks, /history, /unverified, /mechanics,
# /analytics, /zone/:slug) via BrowserRouter, so every path must serve
# index.html and let the router resolve it. Without this, a deep link — the
# whole point of making stations linkable across screens — 404s on hard load.
#
# Vercel does the same job via the `rewrites` block in vercel.json; both files
# are kept so either host works without edits.
/*    /index.html   200
